; A windmill's sails turning in a gap, on ground that shrinks (issue #143:
; two of #52's RotatingPlatforms crossed at one hub, plus #53's timed
; CollapsingFloor). Carousel has a lone spinner over solid ground. Here the
; sails are the only way across a gap.
;
; **Ground.** Two fields (x=+-260..+-600, top y=320) hold all eight spawns.
; Past each field is a timed CollapsingFloor (x=+-600..+-740, the same
; top). It holds for 20 s, warns for 2 s, then drops for the rest of the
; round, so the ring-out edge moves in by 140 px mid-round. Until then the
; outer ends are open sky.
;
; **Sails.** Two 400 px bars on one hub at (0, 300), 90 degrees apart,
; turning at 22 deg/s. There is always one sail near level, a bridge
; across the 520 px gap, and one near upright, a wall between the fields.
; Each quarter turn (about 4 s) they swap. The tips sweep a 200 px radius,
; 60 px short of either field's lip. Riding the upright sail up is the way
; to the pickup above the hub (0, 40), just outside the tips' circle.
; Falling between the sails is a ring-out.

; Backdrop (issue #117): harvest evening over farmland.
